CORE
main.c
--unwindset z_f.0:1 -- --apply-loop-contracts _ --no-standard-checks
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
--
Same setup as loop_contracts_after_unwinding-01. Functions are processed in
name order, so a_acq is instrumented before it is inlined into z_f. Location
numbers must be restored before inlining; with stale location numbers the
instrumentation aborted with a precondition failure in goto_inlinet::add_segment.
